{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_1_level_main_01-06_beg",
  "groupId": "main_1",
  "stageId": "main_01-06",
  "title": "灾难",
  "storyCode": "1-6",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_01-06_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "3ebb45120b5e540deb1dbd4194f22e13db2590fdc3fdca0099949ca131fc52eb",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第九关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "是的，他们不知道自己被浮士德跟踪。我从浮士德派回来的斥候那里了解到了一些情报。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "罗德岛确实被困在中城区的外围了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "虽然是些虫子，但他们也可能趁着天灾带来混乱逃跑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "以他们对切尔诺伯格现状的了解，说不定会干扰到我们的计划。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "——至少，把他们铲除掉没有任何坏处。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "————",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "text": "切尔诺伯格的混蛋，都是你们，都是你们，害得我们感染者变成这样！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "闪开！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "text": "呜！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "这些人，只不过是在前仆后继地送死！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "临光",
      "text": "整合运动怎么全都陷入了狂躁状态？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "为什么这个时候，这里会聚集着这么多整合运动？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "不合常理！整合运动根本没有坚守这里的理由！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "临光",
      "text": "罗德岛干员们，不要退缩！击退整合运动，打开撤退路径！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "————",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "那些人就是情报中说的“罗德岛”？呵......很英勇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "text": "......啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "text": "......落石？这个时候？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "别停下！优先确保防线！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "text": "不对......是砸在建筑物上迸出来的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "你在说什么——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "text": "来了！来了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "text": "哈哈......我们感染者的救赎！普通人的末日！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "text": "啊，啊啊——咕！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "text": "啊，啊啊——咕！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "他是被什么东西......击倒的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "你们有谁......攻击了他？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "还是说，他是被......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "杜宾！天空......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "临光",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "临光",
      "text": "天空陷入了血色——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "临光",
      "text": "“沸腾的乌云翻涌在火焰之中......”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "text": "别惊慌！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "临光",
      "text": "保护好自己！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "......我们还有机会，用行动去拯救自己的生命！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "“——大地陷入寂静，恐惧取走了他们的声音。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "“巨大的源石垂下头颅——”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "“——坠落，它坠落在死亡焦热的阴影。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "text": "塔露拉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "text": "要怎么做？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "————也许他们能自天灾中幸存。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "漏网之人，你去处理。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "text": "是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "虽然已经想到，整合运动要利用天灾复仇......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "没想到，他们居然会选择让天灾彻底毁灭切尔诺伯格——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "比起报复，这更像是宣誓......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "感染者的时代......吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "text": "啊......啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "text": "整个天空......都要掉下来了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "text": "小心！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "text": "那是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "清醒点！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "text": "——啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "保护医生，快带她去安全的地方！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "text": "明白！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "text": "干员们，各自寻找安全位置！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "各小队！准备好......应对天灾！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
